  "description": [
    "Faint lights dot the landscape on a northwestern ridge, and a thick, forested wall obscures visibility far to the east.  The spent riverbed winds aimlessly around large clusters of maiden grass before a sharp turn to the south leads it out of view through the thick grasses.  Raised on stout pillars, a cypress shelter displays a variety of heraldry secured above numerous booths and kiosks."
